# Environment Variables — Roman Aviation / AURA Travels

Copy this file to `backend/.env` and fill in the values.
The frontend uses `frontend/.env.local` for its variables.

---

## Backend (`backend/.env`)

```env
# ─── Django Core ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secret key for JWT signing and Django sessions.
# Generate with: python -c "from django.core.management.utils import get_random_secret_key; print(get_random_secret_key())"
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-key-here

# Set to "production" in prod (enables HTTPS redirects, secure cookies, etc.)
NODE_ENV=development


# ─── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave empty in development to use SQLite3 (auto-created as db.sqlite3)
# Set in production for PostgreSQL:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://username:password@hostname:5432/database_name
DATABASE_URL=


# ─── Email (optional in dev) ──────────────────────────────────
# If not set, emails are printed to the Django console (OTP visible in terminal).
# Use a Gmail account with an App Password (not your real password).
EMAIL_HOST_USER=
EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD=
DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL=AURA Travels <noreply@auratravels.com>


# ─── Twilio (SMS OTP) ─────────────────────────────────────────
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER=+1234567890


# ─── SendGrid (alternative email) ────────────────────────────
SENDGRID_API_KEY=


# ─── AWS S3 (file uploads) ───────────────────────────────────
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_STORAGE_BUCKET_NAME=
AWS_S3_REGION_NAME=ap-south-1


# ─── Redis / Celery ───────────────────────────────────────────
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0


# ─── Payment Gateway ──────────────────────────────────────────
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
```

---

## Frontend (`frontend/.env.local`)

```env
# Backend API base URL (used by Axios client in src/utils/api.ts)
# In dev, Django runs on 8000.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api

# LiteAPI (hotel search integration)
NEXT_PUBLIC_LITEAPI_KEY=
```

---

## Notes

| Variable | Required | Default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `JWT_SECRET` | Dev: No | Insecure fallback used | **Required in prod** |
| `DATABASE_URL` | Dev: No | SQLite3 | Required for PostgreSQL |
| `EMAIL_HOST_USER` | No | Console backend | OTP printed to terminal |
| `AWS_*` | No | File upload disabled | Required for CV/photo upload |
| `REDIS_URL` | No | Not needed in dev | Required for Celery |
| `RAZORPAY_*` | No | Payments fail silently | Required for live payments |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` | No | `http://localhost:5000/api` | Should be `8000` in dev |
